@OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148

### Create an order
POST {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ahmed",
  "items": [
    { "productName": "Keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 450 },
    { "productName": "Mouse", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 150 }
  ]
}

### Get order by id
GET {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Accept: application/json

### List orders
GET {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Dashboard
GET {{OrderManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/orders
Accept: application/json
